OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with a band of rain
OL,6,Fmoving eastwards across the region,
OL,7,Fthis could fall as freezing rain
OL,8,Fbefore turning to snow over high
OL,9,Fground. Winds will become increasingly
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy at first with
OL,13,Frain and snow retreating westwards
OL,14,Fovernight allowing some breaks in the
OL,15,Fcloud to develop mainly in the east
OL,16,Fand frost to form. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
