OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry and cloudy in the west
OL,6,Fand clear skies in the east, though an
OL,7,Fisolated coastal shower cannot be
OL,8,Fruled out. Winds become light but
OL,9,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FMainly cloudy and dry on Thursday.
OL,13,FFriday and Saturday turn increasingly
OL,14,Fwetter and unsettled with snow
OL,15,Fpossible over high ground. Feeling
OL,16,Fchilly away from the coast, with
OL,17,Ftemperatures below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
